@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
title Content revision lifecycle | immutable publication
[*] --> Draft : create revision
Draft --> InReview : submit preview + review material
InReview --> Draft : request corrections
InReview --> Ready : review recorded and validation passes
Ready --> Draft : edit invalidates review readiness
Ready --> Published : explicit publish succeeds atomically
Published --> Withdrawn : confirm withdrawal with reason
Withdrawn --> [*] : retained as historical unavailable revision
note right of Ready
Schema, media, reachability and compatibility checks pass.
Expected draft version checked again on publish.
Failed publication stays Ready and keeps the live pointer.
end note
note right of Published
Immutable content data.
Editing creates a different Draft revision.
Publishing R2 does not mutate or withdraw R1.
New attempts use the current live pointer.
Existing R1 attempts may continue until withdrawal.
end note
@enduml
